<title>USA: Wavetech acquires Telplex assets.</title>
<headline>Wavetech acquires Telplex assets.</headline>
<dateline>TUCSON, Ariz. 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wavetech Inc Thursday said it acquired the assets and goodwill of Telplex Inc, a privately-owned U.S. Federal Communications Commission licensed reseller of wholesale switchless international voice and data long distance service, for cash and stock.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>In a statement, Wavetech said Telplex is expected to contribute revenues of approximately $5 million and earnings of about $.02 a share in calendar 1997.</p>
